OL,3,GNEWSADisruption at Port of Dover as
OL,4,Amasked men hold protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere is major disruption at the Port
OL,7,Fof Dover due to a large group of masked
OL,8,Fmen holding a demonstration.
OL,10,FKent Police said it was aware of a
OL,11,Fdemonstration currently taking place at
OL,12,Fthe ferry terminal and was "engaging
OL,13,Fwith protesters".
OL,15,FTraffic has been stopped from going in
OL,16,Fand out of the port.
OL,18,FImages from the scene appear to show
OL,19,Fhundreds of protesters, all dressed in
OL,20,Fblack and wearing face coverings.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
